WEBVTT

00:00:14.227 --> 00:00:19.733
<i>What's this feeling I have,</i>
<i>as if I'm looking forward to...</i>

00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:25.939
<i>... somebody firing off his</i>
<i>missiles and ending everything?</i>

00:00:25.939 --> 00:00:31.378
<i>Is it a bad thing, or is this normal?</i>

00:00:31.378 --> 00:00:37.884
<i>I can't figure it out on my</i>
<i>own, so somebody tell me!</i>

00:00:37.884 --> 00:00:43.490
<i>And that person I love has once again...</i>

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:49.930
<i>... gone far away without anybody noticing.</i>

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:56.103
<i>Where have my dreams gone since then?</i>

00:00:56.103 --> 00:01:01.775
<i>I could swear that they</i>
<i>were right here long ago.</i>

00:01:01.775 --> 00:01:07.814
<i>We had a love that set our hearts on fire.</i>

00:01:07.814 --> 00:01:20.784
<i>Let's take back that feeling we had back then!</i>

00:01:46.987 --> 00:01:49.046
Here goes...

00:02:15.515 --> 00:02:18.746
A hot cup really hits the
spot after a job well done!

00:02:20.921 --> 00:02:22.989
Hello? Masaki here.

00:02:22.989 --> 00:02:24.891
Tenchi? Help me!

00:02:24.891 --> 00:02:26.358
Sasami?

00:02:38.572 --> 00:02:40.802
Tenchi!

00:02:42.142 --> 00:02:44.007
Sasami?

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:56.653
So what the heck happened?

00:02:57.624 --> 00:03:05.030
Well... A while ago, Ryo-Ohki
made <i>17,534</i> yen working.

00:03:09.803 --> 00:03:13.073
And everybody tried to take it.

00:03:13.073 --> 00:03:14.904
They what?

00:04:18.171 --> 00:04:20.040
What are you people doing here?

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:21.608
Us? What about you, Ryoko?

00:04:21.608 --> 00:04:24.941
What're you guys doing?

00:04:30.951 --> 00:04:33.253
I'm out of spending money.

00:04:33.253 --> 00:04:36.780
Come on, let me borrow a little!

00:04:37.691 --> 00:04:40.560
We just want to buy back
the Galaxy Police I.D.'s,

00:04:40.560 --> 00:04:45.031
handcuffs, and guns we pawned!

00:04:45.031 --> 00:04:47.534
We're short on money
this month, so we had to!

00:04:47.534 --> 00:04:50.570
We have to buy them back
soon before someone else does!

00:04:50.570 --> 00:04:52.439
That would be a disaster, right?

00:04:52.439 --> 00:04:58.011
Without Tenchi around lately,
I've needed guinea pigs to experiment on...

00:04:58.011 --> 00:05:02.749
It's a woman's duty to maintain
her beauty for her beloved.

00:05:02.749 --> 00:05:07.152
And to do that, I want to buy
this seven-piece beauty care set!

00:05:08.488 --> 00:05:13.827
You don't have any plans for that
money, right? Let us borrow some!

00:05:13.827 --> 00:05:17.631
Please! Lend us some money!

00:05:17.631 --> 00:05:19.833
We'll pay you back!

00:05:19.833 --> 00:05:21.735
For pity's sake!

00:05:21.735 --> 00:05:24.203
You don't mind, do you, Sasami?

00:05:27.007 --> 00:05:29.100
Come on!

00:05:30.477 --> 00:05:32.138
Well?

00:05:32.512 --> 00:05:34.070
Well?

00:05:34.681 --> 00:05:36.205
Well?

00:05:36.516 --> 00:05:38.814
Well? Come on!

00:05:45.258 --> 00:05:48.728
So that's why I ran away here.

00:05:48.728 --> 00:05:51.665
Damn it, I can't believe those guys...

00:05:51.665 --> 00:05:57.137
But what are you going to do,
Sasami? You can't stay here forever.

00:05:57.137 --> 00:05:59.739
And I have school tomorrow, too.

00:05:59.739 --> 00:06:01.673
Yeah...

00:06:09.215 --> 00:06:11.547
Maybe I should spend it.

00:06:20.326 --> 00:06:23.557
This girl who has come
might prove to be interesting.

00:06:25.065 --> 00:06:30.401
Play with me, Sasami.
I'll invite you to my world.

00:06:31.071 --> 00:06:32.561
Tsugaru!

00:06:44.918 --> 00:06:47.512
Tenchi! Look! Look!

00:06:49.155 --> 00:06:50.816
Lemme see...

00:06:54.994 --> 00:06:56.663
Isn't this pretty?

00:06:56.663 --> 00:06:58.654
That's all chocolate?

00:07:07.707 --> 00:07:09.072
Ryo-Ohki!

00:07:19.486 --> 00:07:21.454
Ryo-Ohki!

00:07:25.792 --> 00:07:28.192
Ryo-Ohki! You're hopeless!

00:07:35.902 --> 00:07:37.704
What?

00:07:37.704 --> 00:07:41.504
It's almost like we're out on a date, Sasami.

00:07:48.148 --> 00:07:51.684
Hey, Tenchi, let's look at that store next!

00:07:51.684 --> 00:07:53.174
Sure.

00:08:13.506 --> 00:08:15.708
What is it?

00:08:15.708 --> 00:08:18.438
Nothing.

00:08:36.129 --> 00:08:38.998
Wow! There's lots of neat stuff here, too!

00:08:38.998 --> 00:08:41.034
Wait for me, Sasami!

00:08:41.034 --> 00:08:44.070
You should get more exercise, Tenchi!

00:08:44.070 --> 00:08:46.231
C'mon! This way!

00:09:16.903 --> 00:09:19.339
Huh? Sasami?

00:09:19.339 --> 00:09:21.239
Sasami?

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:40.560
Wow, that's pretty!

00:09:40.560 --> 00:09:44.864
Does anything catch your eye?

00:09:44.864 --> 00:09:48.527
That looks wonderful on you, Miss.

00:09:49.569 --> 00:09:50.870
Ryo-Ohki?

00:09:50.870 --> 00:09:53.439
Oh, dear. Was it something I did?

00:09:53.439 --> 00:09:57.110
I'm sorry. This doesn't usually happen.

00:09:57.110 --> 00:09:59.812
Oh, that's all right.

00:09:59.812 --> 00:10:03.316
If you find anything, just let me know.

00:10:03.316 --> 00:10:05.648
Behave yourself, Ryo-Ohki!

00:10:08.054 --> 00:10:12.115
Man, where did Sasami go?

00:10:12.859 --> 00:10:15.261
Sasami! You had me worried!

00:10:15.261 --> 00:10:17.797
What a coincidence! Are you out shopping?

00:10:17.797 --> 00:10:19.632
Kumashiro...

00:10:19.632 --> 00:10:22.168
Masaki... Are you
doing anything right now?

00:10:22.168 --> 00:10:25.071
Uh... I'm sort of in
the middle of something.

00:10:25.071 --> 00:10:27.006
Could you come with me for a bit?

00:10:27.006 --> 00:10:29.907
Uh... All right.

00:10:48.261 --> 00:10:51.059
Wow, that's so pretty!

00:11:27.867 --> 00:11:31.359
I'm starving...

00:11:33.473 --> 00:11:37.110
Sasami! Where'd you go?

00:11:37.110 --> 00:11:42.081
I never thought I'd feel the
pangs of hunger in this age of plenty.

00:11:42.081 --> 00:11:47.153
And it's all because you tried
to take Sasami's money, Ryoko!

00:11:47.153 --> 00:11:50.816
Say what? You were after it, too!

00:11:51.391 --> 00:11:53.893
Oh, forget it... I don't have the energy.

00:11:53.893 --> 00:11:58.431
So I'll go and make dinner, then!

00:11:58.431 --> 00:12:01.134
Forget it! If you go into that kitchen,

00:12:01.134 --> 00:12:06.773
you'll break the faucets,
chop the cutting board in half,

00:12:06.773 --> 00:12:09.742
break all the dishes, and
then set off a gas explosion!

00:12:09.742 --> 00:12:14.941
You're so mean, Kiyone! I'd never do that!

00:12:22.722 --> 00:12:25.491
Wh-What's that delicious smell?

00:12:25.491 --> 00:12:28.619
Who in the world is cooking?

00:12:37.136 --> 00:12:39.072
Sorry for the wait!

00:12:39.072 --> 00:12:41.207
Washu! What did you make?

00:12:41.207 --> 00:12:44.744
That aroma... It's so rich and tantalizing...

00:12:44.744 --> 00:12:48.281
Washu, you didn't break
the dinner set, did you?

00:12:48.281 --> 00:12:50.383
She's not like you, okay?!

00:12:50.383 --> 00:12:54.020
But I didn't know you could cook, Washu!

00:12:54.020 --> 00:12:56.580
You're right! I can't.

00:12:58.257 --> 00:13:01.260
But I watched others do it,

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:04.464
plus I used my genetic engineering skills!

00:13:04.464 --> 00:13:06.125
Oops.

00:13:07.767 --> 00:13:12.136
I can guarantee the taste, so
who's gonna be first to take a bite?

00:13:16.375 --> 00:13:19.811
No way!

00:13:31.791 --> 00:13:34.160
Do you want this?

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:36.996
Here. You can have it.

00:13:36.996 --> 00:13:38.987
Thank you.

00:13:41.634 --> 00:13:43.932
How cute!

00:13:48.708 --> 00:13:50.443
I'm Yugi.

00:13:50.443 --> 00:13:53.970
I'm Sasami. Nice to meet you.

00:13:54.780 --> 00:13:59.085
And this is my friend, Ryo-Ohki.

00:13:59.085 --> 00:14:02.452
Hi there, Ryo-Ohki.

00:14:15.134 --> 00:14:17.270
Try it on!

00:14:17.270 --> 00:14:18.862
Neat!

00:14:26.045 --> 00:14:28.445
Here you are. Thank you.

00:14:30.149 --> 00:14:31.651
Sasami?

00:14:31.651 --> 00:14:34.051
We're friends, aren't we?

00:14:35.721 --> 00:14:37.790
Yep. We're friends.

00:14:37.790 --> 00:14:41.994
Then how would you like
to come to my house to play?

00:14:41.994 --> 00:14:43.629
Well, that sounds like fun, but...

00:14:43.629 --> 00:14:46.132
Then let's go right away!

00:14:46.132 --> 00:14:49.068
Huh? But the exit's that way!

00:14:49.068 --> 00:14:51.400
This is the right way.

00:14:53.873 --> 00:14:55.670
Huh?

00:14:58.277 --> 00:15:01.681
Hurry up, Sasami!

00:15:01.681 --> 00:15:03.512
Hurry up!

00:15:04.217 --> 00:15:06.048
Coming!

00:15:17.296 --> 00:15:18.864
Where are we?

00:15:18.864 --> 00:15:20.766
Sasami!

00:15:20.766 --> 00:15:23.064
This way!

00:15:24.503 --> 00:15:26.471
Yugi?

00:15:43.489 --> 00:15:44.490
Where are we?

00:15:44.490 --> 00:15:46.856
You awake, Sasami?

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:48.861
Yugi?

00:15:48.861 --> 00:15:51.897
Let's play here, Sasami.

00:15:51.897 --> 00:15:53.831
But...

00:15:54.867 --> 00:15:56.736
But what?

00:15:56.736 --> 00:15:59.205
There's something
really bad about this place.

00:15:59.205 --> 00:16:00.406
Something bad?

00:16:00.406 --> 00:16:03.609
Yeah! Something evil!

00:16:03.609 --> 00:16:04.944
Evil?

00:16:04.944 --> 00:16:08.814
We can't stay here! There ought
to be a way out someplace!

00:16:08.814 --> 00:16:10.543
Let's look for it!

00:16:25.564 --> 00:16:27.700
Who's there?

00:16:27.700 --> 00:16:30.897
And where might you be going, ladies?

00:16:32.438 --> 00:16:33.996
Look out!

00:16:35.508 --> 00:16:39.745
This is the mirror world.
You'll never get out!

00:16:39.745 --> 00:16:42.145
Mirror world?

00:16:48.888 --> 00:16:51.118
Now, Yugi! Run!

00:16:55.227 --> 00:16:57.787
Stop! Stop it!

00:17:12.345 --> 00:17:14.643
Send us back!

00:17:15.448 --> 00:17:19.151
No, you can't go yet. Let's play some more!

00:17:19.151 --> 00:17:20.486
Stop fooling around!

00:17:20.486 --> 00:17:23.422
But if you insist on leaving...

00:17:23.422 --> 00:17:25.390
...then die!

00:17:42.541 --> 00:17:44.844
Thanks, Ryo-Ohki!

00:17:44.844 --> 00:17:46.744
Not bad.

00:17:49.949 --> 00:17:51.644
Look out!

00:17:55.454 --> 00:17:58.651
You're okay, Yugi? Thank goodness...

00:18:02.294 --> 00:18:05.064
You shouldn't have thought about leaving.

00:18:05.064 --> 00:18:07.658
And now I think I'll finish you off!

00:18:08.267 --> 00:18:10.235
Wh-What?

00:18:48.474 --> 00:18:50.135
I'll remember this!

00:18:54.713 --> 00:18:57.113
Ryo-Ohki! Open up a way out!

00:18:58.918 --> 00:19:00.886
Fire!

00:19:23.209 --> 00:19:25.244
Ow...

00:19:25.244 --> 00:19:27.980
Yugi, you're okay!

00:19:27.980 --> 00:19:29.709
Yeah.

00:19:33.586 --> 00:19:35.654
How about you, Sasami? Are you okay?

00:19:35.654 --> 00:19:36.789
Yeah!

00:19:36.789 --> 00:19:39.553
Sasami!

00:19:42.261 --> 00:19:44.997
You had me worried, Sasami!

00:19:44.997 --> 00:19:47.466
You know you shouldn't
wander off by yourself!

00:19:47.466 --> 00:19:48.934
I'm sorry.

00:19:48.934 --> 00:19:56.075
Oh, right. Tenchi, this
is Yugi. She's my friend.

00:19:56.075 --> 00:19:58.744
How do you do?

00:19:58.744 --> 00:20:00.613
Hi.

00:20:00.613 --> 00:20:02.342
Here.

00:20:06.051 --> 00:20:09.384
But I thought it was broken!

00:20:11.790 --> 00:20:15.528
There's something sad about music boxes.

00:20:15.528 --> 00:20:18.397
No matter how happy a song they play,

00:20:18.397 --> 00:20:22.094
it always comes to an end.

00:20:25.604 --> 00:20:31.510
Masaki, will you go out
with me? Steady, I mean.

00:20:31.510 --> 00:20:33.479
Kumashiro...

00:20:33.479 --> 00:20:37.516
I'm sorry. I'm... I'm just
not ready for that yet.

00:20:37.516 --> 00:20:39.552
Then... You don't like me?

00:20:39.552 --> 00:20:42.988
No, I... I just...

00:20:45.057 --> 00:20:47.048
Kumashiro...

00:20:51.997 --> 00:20:54.989
See you later, Sasami!

00:21:02.041 --> 00:21:06.712
I'm starving... Sasami!

00:21:06.712 --> 00:21:11.615
Come home!

00:21:36.208 --> 00:21:39.812
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:39.812 --> 00:21:43.716
<i>Sleeping late, staying up late,</i>
<i>and napping all the time!</i>

00:21:43.716 --> 00:21:47.319
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:47.319 --> 00:21:51.256
<i>Sneaking bites to eat, midnight</i>
<i>snacks, and pouring tea on my rice!</i>

00:21:51.256 --> 00:21:54.760
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:54.760 --> 00:21:58.731
<i>Playing video games and singing karaoke!</i>

00:21:58.731 --> 00:22:02.067
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:22:02.067 --> 00:22:06.071
<i>Lying in the sun and taking baths outside!</i>

00:22:06.071 --> 00:22:08.207
<i>- Taking side trips!</i>
<i>- Gossiping!</i>

00:22:08.207 --> 00:22:10.142
<i>- Taking long baths</i>
<i>- Wasting my money!</i>

00:22:10.142 --> 00:22:11.644
<i>- Being a busybody!</i>
<i>- Talking forever on the phone!</i>

00:22:11.644 --> 00:22:17.483
<i>- Unrequited love!</i>
<i>- Stealing other people's men!</i>

00:22:17.483 --> 00:22:21.587
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:21.587 --> 00:22:24.857
<i>no matter how old I get!</i>

00:22:24.857 --> 00:22:28.394
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:28.394 --> 00:22:33.093
<i>even if I die, change shape, or get reborn!</i>

00:22:44.243 --> 00:22:48.013
Galaxy Police Detective
First Grade Kiyone here.

00:22:48.013 --> 00:22:50.516
Tomorrow will be our Tenchi Anniversary!

00:22:50.516 --> 00:22:54.286
It's the day that commemorates
when we first met Tenchi!

00:22:54.286 --> 00:22:59.591
These two years since we
landed here on Earth have flown by.

00:22:59.591 --> 00:23:02.961
And since that day, my career...

00:23:02.961 --> 00:23:05.631
My career!

00:23:05.631 --> 00:23:11.126
Next time on <i>Tenchi in Tokyo:</i>
"The Day We Met."
